hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1693","**\nNarrated to us Ahmad ibn 'Abdah, narrated to us 'Abd al-'Aziz, narrated to us al-'Ala' ibn 'Abd al-Rahman, on the authority of his father, on the authority of Abu Hurayrah (RA), who said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"The best rows for men are the front ones, and the worst are the last ones. The best rows for women are the last ones, and the worst are the front ones.\""
